{"ID":"20240220132628-6nrrhwq","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132628-6nrrhwq","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132628-6nrrhwq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312163426-n6p0l1e\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312163426-t7h3yo0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312163426-t7h3yo0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:52,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:52\u0026#125;","title":"【桂枝去芍药加蜀漆龙骨牡蛎救逆汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312163426"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312163426-n6p0l1e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163426-n6p0l1e","updated":"20240312163426"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第一百二十五条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163426-j44a3ow","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163426-j44a3ow","updated":"20240312163426"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「伤寒」,脉浮,医以火迫劫之,「亡阳」,必惊狂,起卧不安者,「桂枝去芍药加蜀漆龙骨牡蛎救逆汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163426-2l8ah8r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163426-2l8ah8r","updated":"20240312163426"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个处方最有名的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"治疗烫伤第一方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。在救逆的时候，救逆就是所谓紧急的时候使用，张仲景就会把芍药拿掉。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"危险的时候都会把芍药拿掉，因为芍药是收敛的药。是酸味的药，把芍药拿掉，阳回头的力量会非常强。如果芍药加在里面，速度反而会减缓。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312163426-ysg9arj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163426-ysg9arj","updated":"20240312163426"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"伤寒，脉浮，应该是发表，麻黄汤就好了。结果医生用火去攻它，流汗，出现亡阳。人在外面有阳，因为有阳所以可以把身体的津液固住，不会流失津液，你用火硬去攻它，这是毛孔打开来了，就亡阳。亡阳的现象，必惊狂,焦虑，起卧不安者。当有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"起卧不安，焦虑，惊狂的时候，都可以用「桂枝去芍药加蜀漆龙骨牡蛎救逆汤」"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，不一定非是说从火灾里面跑出来。病人焦虑、害怕、你没有办法控制他，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"情绪不好，睡觉又失眠，都可以使用这个药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163426-e9jjb9h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163426-e9jjb9h","updated":"20240312163426"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用桂枝的原因，因为桂枝走肌肉，会到皮肤表面上去。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163426-d9i89xx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163426-d9i89xx","updated":"20240312163426"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝去芍药加蜀漆龙骨牡蛎救逆汤方"}]},{"ID":"20240312163426-psi769v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163426-psi769v","updated":"20240312163426"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝三两去皮，甘草二两炙，生姜三两切，牡蛎五两，龙骨四两，大枣十二枚劈，蜀漆三两洗,去腥。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163426-3ivhawz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163426-3ivhawz","updated":"20240312163426"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"蜀漆用常山苗"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"代替。蜀漆去痰的力量很强,受惊吓的时候,容易有痰涎壅塞,可以用蜀漆或常山苗把痰清掉。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163426-lsirvmd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163426-lsirvmd","updated":"20240312163426"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"烫伤的时候，外敷："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"过去用牡蛎打粉,牡蛎可以排水。磨得细一点,加麻油,更好的用硫磺、大黄,硫磺就是在火山口的东西,硫磺本身外用时非常的寒凉,外敷的时候是寒凉的。吃到身体里是燥热，极热的。西医就把硫磺跟膏药一起在烫伤的时候用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163426-fcojntl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163426-fcojntl","updated":"20240312163426"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"伤寒的时候我们绝对不要用火去发汗。有的人本身没有火劫，临床上看，吃了安眠药，抗忧郁药以后，人变的惊狂，坐卧不安，没办法睡觉，失眠，都可以使用。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163426-t7h3yo0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163426-t7h3yo0","updated":"20240312163426"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个药"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"先煮蜀漆，因为蜀漆比较毒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，实际上我现在已经不用蜀漆了。但是从这里看到，张仲景有预防蜀漆中毒的意识。"}]}]}